<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>Aevon 0.0.26（arm64e / roothide）。所有功能只在本页开关，无需终端 / SSH。用法：打开「启用插件」→ 注销 → 在下方设定的热区内向左滑（或按住约 0.4 秒）呼出圆盘；逆时针转半圈后图标开始跟手旋转，顺时针或停住即进入选择，松手开窗。日志：/var/mobile/Aevon.log。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>Aevon 分屏</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用插件</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>EdgeGestureEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>右侧边缘左滑呼出圆盘（主入口）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>BubbleEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>显示桌面悬浮球（备用入口）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>只有贴着屏幕右边缘的这块区域里的左滑 / 长按才能呼出圆盘。位置 = 区域中心在屏幕高度的百分比（75 与圆盘圆心对齐；想贴底部就拉到 95~98，想贴顶部拉到 2~5）。宽度 = 从右边缘往里多少 pt（越小越不容易误触）。高度 = 热区上下多高。改完立即生效，无需注销。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>RingTriggerY</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>触发位置（屏幕高度 %）</string>
			<key>minValue</key>
			<integer>0</integer>
			<key>maxValue</key>
			<integer>100</integer>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>75</integer>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>RingTriggerWidth</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>触发宽度（pt）</string>
			<key>minValue</key>
			<integer>18</integer>
			<key>maxValue</key>
			<integer>140</integer>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>48</integer>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSliderCell</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>RingTriggerHeight</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>触发高度（pt）</string>
			<key>minValue</key>
			<integer>80</integer>
			<key>maxValue</key>
			<integer>900</integer>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>320</integer>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>「窗口保活」让浮窗里的 App 持续运行（会消耗电量）。「浮窗内可直接触摸操作」关闭后浮窗只显示画面、不响应点击。「拖到屏幕边缘自动吸附」：把标题栏拖到左/右边缘松手即变半屏，拖到顶部放大。窗口大小与位置会按 App 记住，下次开窗恢复。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>窗口</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>KeepAlive</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>窗口保活（保持前台）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>TouchEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>浮窗内可直接触摸操作</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>SnapEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>拖到屏幕边缘自动吸附（左右半屏）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>SwitcherLongPress</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>多任务卡片长按开窗（实验）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>「开机崩溃保护」：每次加载写入 loading，SpringBoard 稳定 20 秒后标记 healthy；若下次启动发现上次仍是 loading，则自动禁用插件，阻断崩溃死循环。「写日志文件」关闭后仍保留系统日志（Console.app 可查）。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>安全与日志</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>CrashGuard</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>开机崩溃保护</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>LogEnabled</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>写日志文件（/var/mobile/Aevon.log）</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>「强制前台保持」会改写系统场景状态，风险最高：若开启后注销进入安全模式，请先关闭本项再注销。</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>实验功能</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.Aevon</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ForceForeground</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>强制前台保持（实验）</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>Aevon</string>
</dict>
</plist>
